      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i've been feeling super drained lately, like zero energy throughout the day. i think my iron is low. i want to start taking supplements but i want to see results fast so i was thinking of doing like 100mg of ferrous sulfate every single day? is that a good way to optimize my levels quickly?",
