    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but i can't really afford to go to the doctor right now for bloodwork and all that. i've read online that people in the biohacking community do much higher doses than that to really \"reset\" their levels. i'm pretty healthy otherwise, just tired. if i wanted to really aggressively target this and get my energy back in a week or two, wouldn't a higher dose like 300mg make more sense? wouldn't that just get the job done faster?",
